Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzgyMDY4MDAyLCJpYXQiOjE3ODIwNjQ0MDIsImp0aSI6IjNlYjk3Mzk2YzM4MzRhNTFhNWZmMDAyZmQ1ZTQ3YjVkIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjMifQ.Fs8T015wa_nzR0gTjUlAZlkrOlK9isCkbGTT5SksaIk

### 11. Hospital B decrypts the record using the retrieved key
